OL,3,GNEWSAJapan ambassador visits Kent
OL,4,Asamurai's home town
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan's ambassador to the UK has
OL,7,Fvisited the Medway church where the
OL,8,Ffirst and only English samurai was
OL,9,Fbaptised.
OL,11,FHiroshi Suzuki called in at St Mary
OL,12,FMagdalene Church in Gillingham on
OL,13,FThursday to mark the anniversary of
OL,14,Fformer resident William Adams'
OL,15,Fchristening, which took place at the
OL,16,Fparish on 24 September 1564.
OL,18,FA navigator and merchant-adventurer,
OL,19,FAdams was made a samurai by feudal
OL,20,FJapan's military ruler, or shogun,
OL,21,Fafter becoming shipwrecked there 426
OL,22,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
